[{"id":65559,"sender_id":25,"sender_full_name":"David_Corfield","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7d52fbe20c8ac05886a296e9ee2159b1?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65559\">#1</a> Is something odd going on on nLab? I was seeing 500 errors at several pages, and now I’m sent straight to an edit page for an entry.</p>","timestamp":1511521974,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65560,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65560\">#2</a> Adeel was kindly trying to fix the bugs that were being triggered by the entry “<a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/A%20first%20idea%20of%20quantum%20field%20theory\">A first idea of quantum field theory</a>”. The nLab should be back to normal now (which means that these bugs remain, but at least on most pages viewing and editing should be as usual).</p>","timestamp":1511525671,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65561,"sender_id":25,"sender_full_name":"David_Corfield","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7d52fbe20c8ac05886a296e9ee2159b1?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65561\">#3</a> Thanks Adeel!</p>","timestamp":1511527583,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65562,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65562\">#4</a> Hm, editing pages still doesn’t seem to work.</p>","timestamp":1511529131,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65563,"sender_id":10,"sender_full_name":"Mike Shulman","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ede34282f405f902e12fa7e6cf336572?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65563\">#5</a> Oh thank goodness; I thought it was a problem with my new external editor extension.  This is really weird behavior: clicking save on an edit page just reloads the edit page.</p>","timestamp":1511530154,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65564,"sender_id":10,"sender_full_name":"Mike Shulman","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ede34282f405f902e12fa7e6cf336572?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65564\">#6</a> And also really annoying, because all attempted edits are silently lost!</p>","timestamp":1511530184,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65566,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65566\">#7</a> While Adeel is absorbed by other duties, we urgently need somebody to offer help with administrating the nLab, and maybe look into fixing the bugs. </p>\n<p>How about Rod McGuire or Dmitri Pavlov?</p>\n<p>Might you have any interest in lending a hand with the admin?</p>","timestamp":1511532834,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65568,"sender_id":78,"sender_full_name":"RodMcGuire","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/93dc0f9f03cdabb6b19a1522bd94c69f?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65568\">#8</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How about Rod McGuire or Dmitri Pavlov?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>sorry but I’m too old and slow.</p>","timestamp":1511534901,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65569,"sender_id":237,"sender_full_name":"Richard Williamson","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b90dbe6063b47a44f7308efebb6ade2b?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65569\">#9</a> I do not have masses of time, but I would be willing to try to help when time permits if you are interested. (My job is as a software engineer, so I should at least be qualified :-).)</p>","timestamp":1511538071,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65570,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65570\">#10</a> Thanks, Richard. I should have thought of you. Probably there are others, too, here, who I am forgetting. I’ll send around an email…</p>","timestamp":1511546558,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65572,"sender_id":10,"sender_full_name":"Mike Shulman","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ede34282f405f902e12fa7e6cf336572?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65572\">#11</a> In principle I could do it — I have plenty of experience with this sort of thing — but it would take a substantial time investment in learning Ruby and Instiki, which I don’t really have available right now (and won’t for the foreseeable future).</p>","timestamp":1511561169,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65587,"sender_id":10,"sender_full_name":"Mike Shulman","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ede34282f405f902e12fa7e6cf336572?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65587\">#12</a> Just to record the resolution in this thread: the problem with editing is fixed, but you may need to clear your cookies to take advantage of it.</p>","timestamp":1511697614,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65592,"sender_id":43,"sender_full_name":"DavidRoberts","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fbc2dbfb28f9e9275a4fd4cd109b5a21?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65592\">#13</a> Clearing cookies worked for me.</p>","timestamp":1511699657,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65594,"sender_id":29,"sender_full_name":"Todd_Trimble","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/078428beaeaddf058781b9be6b2c240f?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65594\">#14</a> It didn’t for me. I cleared my cache and cookies, and tried to edit <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/pi\">pi</a>, and when I hit submit it tells me that the page pi is locked. </p>\n<p>Edit: now I got it to work.</p>","timestamp":1511701869,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]},{"id":65597,"sender_id":11,"sender_full_name":"Urs","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b00d1ee17463af676c78974439b92471?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/5-nLab-General-Discussions/topic/Pages.20showing.20errors/near/65597\">#15</a> Sorry for not saying this earlier. My bad.</p>","timestamp":1511704441,"subject":"Pages showing errors","stream_id":5,"display_recipient":"nLab General Discussions","reactions":[]}]